<title>SPAIN: Spanish 6-mo bills set new record low in yield.</title>
<headline>Spanish 6-mo bills set new record low in yield.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p> ISSUE	Yield    Pvs     Price     Pvs	Bid    Allocated</p>
<p>6-month    5.342    5.865   97.37    97.12     276.7   146.6</p>
<p>NOTE - The yield set a fresh record low.</p>
<p>Previous auction was held on January 2.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
